  "evidence": [
    "HHpred (significant): 23/25 top hits converge on the TPR (tetratricopeptide-repeat) family at Prob 98.6-99.1%, E 1e-7 to 2e-8 (NlpI 1XNF, PEX5 1HXI, Hop 1ELW, SGT 3SZ7, Fis1 1NZN, MamA 3AS5, GmaR 7X9S, plus designed TPR CTPR3/5FZQ); strongest single hit SunS TPR-containing S-glycosyltransferase 99.15% E8.7e-10 shares the repeat. Excellent E-values rule out the all-helical de-novo promiscuity trap. struct_hits + STRING(mca) consistent; strong purifying.",
    "HHpred web (MPI Bioinformatics Toolkit, profile-profile remote homology), interpreted in project 'Still unknown gene function', 2026-06-10. A fold/family-level assignment, not a demonstrated function."
